# Image Hover Effects

All images should have a subtle hover scale effect to indicate interactivity.

## Implementation

- Add `hover:scale-105` class to all `<img>` elements
- Include `transition-transform` for smooth animation
- Use `duration-200` or `duration-300` for the transition timing

## Example

```tsx
<img
  src="/example.png"
  alt="Example"
  className="hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-200"
/>
```

This applies to both regular `<img>` tags and Next.js `Image` components (add the classes to the `className` prop).
